== Description ==

The '''Cutting Workbench''' shapes raw materials into the many building-piece variants (planks, bricks, cement, iron, alloy, glass, stone). Each recipe covers up to 18 shape variants of the same material. It defines 558 raw recipe entries (38 unique after consolidating shape variants), producing outputs including [[Carbonized crystalline brick]], [[Cast Iron]], [[Cement]], [[Chrome Alloy]], [[Chrome Iron]], [[Concrete]], [[Copper Alloy]], [[Damaged brick]], plus 23 more.

== Technical ==

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.CuttingWorkbench</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Cutting</code>.

